Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.borelSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instAdd","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instDivInvMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLT","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instMul","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instOne","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instRCLike","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSub","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instSupSet","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.log","mathlib","definition"],["Real.measurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real.norm","mathlib","instance"],["Real.normedAddCommGroup","mathlib","instance"],["SeminormedAddCommGroup.toPseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Elem","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Ioc","mathlib","definition"],["Set.Ioo","mathlib","definition"],["Set.instMembership","mathlib","instance"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["Sigma","lean4","structure"],["Sigma.fst","lean4","definition"],["Subtype.instMeasurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Subtype.val","lean4","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Unit","lean4","definition"],["WithLp.measurableSpace","mathlib","instance"],["WithLp.ofLp","mathlib","definition"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["fact_one_le_two_ennreal","mathlib","instance"],["iSup","mathlib","definition"],["instCountableFin","mathlib","instance"],["instCountableProd","mathlib","instance"],["instFintypeProd","mathlib","instance"],["instHAdd","lean4","instance"],["instHDiv","lean4","instance"],["instHMul","lean4","instance"],["instHPow","lean4","instance"],["instHSub","lean4","instance"],["instLENat","lean4","instance"],["instOfNatAtLeastTwo","mathlib","instance"],["instOfNatNat","lean4","instance"],["instSecondCountableTopologyReal","mathlib","instance"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":{"decl":"Maiti2026Power.exists_isPAC_blockBallSet","label":"Theorem 7 — polynomial separation: adaptive upper bound O((kd log(8k/δ) + d²)/ε²)","note":"With `blockBallSet_le_budget_of_isFixedDesign_of_isPAC` (non-adaptive lower bound Ω(kd²/ε²)) and `blockBallSet_le_budget_of_isPAC` (Ω(kd log(1/δ)/ε²)) in the same file. Non-adaptive means a deterministic fixed design with an arbitrary recommendation kernel. The two lower bounds are proved (no `sorry`): the adaptive one from Theorem 2 on the block-ball set, the non-adaptive one by projecting the design on the block receiving the fewest rounds (`isPAC_fixedDesignTransport_blockProjBall`) and applying the Bayesian step of Theorem 3 with the width of the unit ball (`le_gwMat_unitBall`). Only the adaptive upper bound `exists_isPAC_blockBallSet` is proved through the seeded block algorithm `Maiti2026Power.BlockParam.alg` (`Maiti2026Power.BlockParam.one_sub_le_seedMeasure_real_output`, `Maiti2026Power.BlockParam.T_le`).","file":"Maiti2026Power/MXJ2026/Separation.lean","source":"formalization.yaml","comparator":{"path":"comparator/exists_isPAC_blockBallSet.json","challenge_module":"Challenge_exists_isPAC_blockBallSet","solution_module":"Solution","theorem_names":["Maiti2026Power.exists_isPAC_blockBallSet"],"permitted_axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"]},"found":true},"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"f1a92e33571fde49fce6355928bb1a73476e5a39","date":"2026-09-13"}},{"id":1215,"name":"Maiti2026Power.isPAC_fixedDesignTransport_blockProjBall","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"Maiti2026Power.MXJ2026.Separation","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"c02b13df69cfba02","local":"88aeb4c686703868","content":"9ce58d81fdc56096"},"doc":"**Restriction of a fixed design to a block** (blueprint `lem:block_restriction`): if the\nfixed-design algorithm `A` with design `x` is `(ε, δ)`-PAC on the block-ball set, the projected\ndesign `blockDesign i x` on the unit ball of `ℝ^d`, with the recommendation of `A` projected on\nblock `i`, is `(ε, δ)`-PAC on the unit ball. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"d","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"T","role":"variable","type":"ℕ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"Learning.IdentAlg Unit ↑(blockBallSet k d) ℝ ↑(blockBallSet k d)"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hA","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.IsFixedBudget T"},{"explicit":false,"name":"x","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → ↑(blockBallSet k d)"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hx","role":"hypothesis","type":"A.alg = Learning.fixedDesignAlg x"},{"explicit":false,"name":"ε","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":false,"name":"δ","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hpac","role":"hypothesis","type":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsPAC (blockBallSet k d) A ε δ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"i","role":"variable","type":"Fin k"}],"conclusion":"Learning.LinearBandit.IsPAC (unitBall (Fin d))\n  (Learning.LinearBandit.fixedDesignTransport A T x (blockDesign i x) ⋯) ε δ","decl":"Maiti2026Power.isPAC_fixedDesignTransport_blockProjBall"},"code":"/-- **Restriction of a fixed design to a block** (blueprint `lem:block_restriction`): if the\nfixed-design algorithm `A` with design `x` is `(ε, δ)`-PAC on the block-ball set, the projected\ndesign `blockDesign i x` on the unit ball of `ℝ^d`, with the recommendation of `A` projected on\nblock `i`, is `(ε, δ)`-PAC on the unit ball. -/\nlemma isPAC_fixedDesignTransport_blockProjBall {k d T : ℕ}\n    {A : IdentAlg Unit (blockBallSet k d) ℝ (blockBallSet k d)} (hA : A.IsFixedBudget T)\n    {x : ℕ → blockBallSet k d} (hx : A.alg = fixedDesignAlg x)\n    {ε δ : ℝ} (hpac : IsPAC (blockBallSet k d) A ε δ) (i : Fin k) :\n    IsPAC (unitBall (Fin d))\n      (fixedDesignTransport A T x (blockDesign i x) (measurable_blockProjBall i)) ε δ","proof":":=\n  isPAC_fixedDesignTransport hA hx hpac (blockEmb i)\n    (fun _ ϑ ↦ (inner_blockEmb_right i _ ϑ).symm) (measurable_blockProjBall i)\n    (fun ϑ y ↦ (simpleRegret_blockBallSet_blockEmb i ϑ y).symm.le)","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/MXJ2026/Separation.lean","start":54,"end":66,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/MXJ2026/Separation.lean#L54-L66"},"deps":[64,86,93,95,499,501,503,1222,1223],"outside":[],"external":[["AddCommGroup.toAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommGroup.toDivisionAddCommMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommMagma.toAdd","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommMonoid.toAddCommSemigroup","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommMonoidWithOne.toAddMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["AddCommSemigroup.toAddCommMagma","mathlib","instance"],["AddHom.mk","mathlib","constructor"],["AddMonoidWithOne.toNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["And","lean4","structure"],["BorelSpace.opensMeasurable","mathlib","instance"],["Classical.arbitrary","mathlib","definition"],["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal","mathlib","definition"],["ENNReal.instAddCommMonoidWithOne","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["EuclideanSpace","mathlib","definition"],["Exists","lean4","inductive"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["Fin.cast","lean4","definition"],["Fin.fintype","mathlib","instance"],["Fin.val","lean4","definition"],["Fintype","mathlib","class"],["HSub.hSub","lean4","definition"],["Inner.inner","mathlib","definition"],["InnerProductSpace","mathlib","class"],["InnerProductSpace.toInner","mathlib","instance"],["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Algorithm","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learnin